rade unions and  the government continue to talk find a  way through this and if there is more  money to be made available for pay it is  really important that that money comes  into the Health Service because we don't  have spare capacity to meet higher wage  okay thank you so much for being on the  program uh this morning really  interesting to talk Matthew Taylor

